# Jarvis UI Quality Rule

- `/jarvis-lab` is a real Jarvis command center, not a debug form.
- Preserve working Core/API behavior.
- Central Jarvis Core must dominate visually.
- Reduce pill/card overload.
- Show real memory/tool/status data only.
- Never expose hidden chain-of-thought.
- Persona and Voice remain independent.
- Keep Discord out of this standalone UI.
- Prefer lightweight effects before WebGL.
- Support reduced motion and minimal-GPU behavior.
- UI effects must not destabilize local AI runtime.
